{% set tiles = [
     ('Doorbell Ring (Doorbell)',        'latest_doorbell_ring_doorbell.jpg'),
     ('Doorbell Ring (Hallway)',         'latest_doorbell_ring_hallway.jpg'),
     ('Doorbell Ring (Waiting Room)',    'latest_doorbell_ring_waiting_room.jpg'),
     ('Strike Unlock +2s (Doorbell)',    'latest_strike_unlock_doorbell.jpg'),
     ('Strike Unlock +2s (Hallway)',     'latest_strike_unlock_hallway.jpg'),
     ('Strike Unlock +2s (Waiting Room)','latest_strike_unlock_waiting_room.jpg'),
     ('CR Exterior Open +3s (Doorbell)', 'latest_control_room_open_doorbell.jpg'),
     ('CR Exterior Open +3s (Hallway)',  'latest_control_room_open_hallway.jpg'),
     ('CR Exterior Open +3s (Waiting Room)','latest_control_room_open_waiting_room.jpg'),
     ('Person (Doorbell)',               'latest_person_doorbell.jpg'),
     ('Person (Hallway)',                'latest_person_hallway.jpg'),
     ('Person (Waiting Room)',           'latest_person_waiting_room.jpg'),
     ('CR Presence (Doorbell)',          'latest_control_room_presence_doorbell.jpg'),
     ('CR Presence (Hallway)',           'latest_control_room_presence_hallway.jpg'),
     ('CR Presence (Waiting Room)',      'latest_control_room_presence_waiting_room.jpg'),
     ('CR Interior Open +2s (Doorbell)', 'latest_control_room_interior_open_doorbell.jpg'),
     ('CR Interior Open +2s (Hallway)',  'latest_control_room_interior_open_hallway.jpg'),
     ('CR Interior Open +2s (Waiting Room)','latest_control_room_interior_open_waiting_room.jpg') ] %}
{% set stale_after = 36 %} {% set ns = namespace(ok=0, missing=0, stale=0) %} {% for label, f in tiles %}
  {% set raw = state_attr('/local/snapshots/' ~ f, 'last-modified') %}
  {% if raw is none %}{% set ns.missing = ns.missing + 1 %}
  {% else %}
    {% set ns.ok = ns.ok + 1 %}
    {% if ((as_timestamp(now()) - as_timestamp(raw)) / 3600) > stale_after %}
      {% set ns.stale = ns.stale + 1 %}{% endif %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %} **{{ ns.ok }} of {{ tiles | length }} tiles exist** &middot; **{{ ns.stale }} stale** (older than {{ stale_after }} h) &middot; **{{ ns.missing }} missing entirely**
| Tile | Captured | Age | |---|---|---| {% for label, f in tiles %}
  {% set raw = state_attr('/local/snapshots/' ~ f, 'last-modified') %}
  {% if raw is none %}
| {{ label }} | **NO FILE** | — |
  {% else %}
  {% set hrs = ((as_timestamp(now()) - as_timestamp(raw)) / 3600) | round(1) %}
| {{ label }} | {{ as_timestamp(raw) | timestamp_custom('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M') }} | {% if hrs > stale_after %}**STALE — {{ hrs }} h**{% else %}{{ hrs }} h{% endif %} |
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
Tiles with **NO FILE** will render blank or broken below - that is the file pipeline, not the dashboard. On 2026-09-16 the live check found the entry-camera loop writing only `doorbell`, `hallway` and `waiting_room` suffixes, so `latest_*_front_hallway.jpg` never exists and the `waiting_room` variants stop after March.

{% set tiles = [
     ('Hallway Periodic (Front Hallway)', 'latest_hallway_periodic_front_hallway.jpg'),
     ('Hallway Periodic (Waiting Room)',  'latest_hallway_periodic_waiting_room.jpg') ] %}
{% for label, f in tiles %}
  {% set raw = state_attr('/local/snapshots/' ~ f, 'last-modified') %}
  {% if raw is none %}
- **{{ label }}** — NO FILE
  {% else %}
  {% set hrs = ((as_timestamp(now()) - as_timestamp(raw)) / 3600) | round(1) %}
- **{{ label }}** — captured
  {{ as_timestamp(raw) | timestamp_custom('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M') }}
  ({{ hrs }} h ago){% if hrs > 36 %} — **STALE**{% endif %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
The 1/min hallway loop is what keeps these current. A tile measured months old means the loop has not run: check `automation.snapshot_hallway_loop_start_ha_start` and `script.hallway_snapshot_loop`.

